CVE-2025-68121

# kin-openapi GHSA in the bundled nebius CLI binary: the vulnerable code is
# kin-openapi's server-side openapi3filter ValidationHandler middleware,
# which the nebius CLI (a client binary invoked by SkyPilot) does not use.
# Fixed upstream in kin-openapi 0.144.0, but no released Nebius CLI is built
# with it yet - latest stable 0.12.306 still ships v0.133.0. Remove this
# entry once Nebius ships a CLI built with kin-openapi >= 0.144.0.
